    "summary": "Teras ERP **Teras ERP** is a high-performance, enterprise-grade Enterprise Resource Planning system built for textile manufacturing and high-volume inventory operations. The stack is **FastAPI + PostgreSQL** on the backend and **Next.js 14 + React 18** on the frontend, purpose-engineered for factory-floor speed and data integrity. --- Key Modules Manufacturing & MES Teras ERP models production as a three-tier hierarchy \u2014 **Production Run \u2192 Manufacturing Order \u2192 Work Order**: - **Production Runs (PR):** Top-level planning document. A run carries one or mo"
